msgstr "5. 確認"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/nats.md:105
msgid ""
"After the broker comes back, the outbox drains and you'll see the result row "
"in `/api/results`. Confirm the new NATS version via the broker's monitoring "
"endpoint:"
msgstr ""
"ブローカーが復帰すると outbox が drain され、`/api/results` に result row が"
"出てきます。新しい NATS バージョンはブローカーの monitoring エンドポイントで"
"確認:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/nats.md:109
msgid ""
"```pwsh\n"
"curl http://<broker>:8222/varz | python -m json.tool | rg version\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```pwsh\n"
"curl http://<broker>:8222/varz | python -m json.tool | rg version\n"
"```"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/nats.md:113
msgid "Why we don't need a separate \"broker update\" mechanism"
msgstr "なぜ独立した「broker update」機構が要らないのか"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/nats.md:115
msgid ""
"Earlier designs considered a dedicated bootstrap channel (parallel NATS link "
"the agent uses just for broker updates) to avoid the self-update-over-broker "
"chicken-and-egg. The outbox + reconnect pair makes that unnecessary: the "
"result is \"merely delayed\", not \"lost\". One transport, one mental model."
msgstr ""
"初期の設計では「ブローカー越しにブローカーを更新する鶏卵問題」を避けるため"
"に専用のブートストラップチャネル (agent が broker update 専用に使う並列 NATS "
"接続) を検討していました。outbox + 再接続のペアによってこれは不要に: "
"結果は「失われる」のではなく「遅延するだけ」。トランスポートはひとつ、"
"メンタルモデルもひとつで済みます。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:3
msgid ""
"Agent self-update is the only component that **doesn't** use "
"`OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` + a `script_object` job. It has dedicated machinery "
"because the agent has to swap its own running binary without ssh — a tighter "
"loop than the generic install jobs."
msgstr ""
"agent の self-update は唯一 `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` + `script_object` ジョブ"
"を **使わない** コンポーネントです。agent は ssh なしで現在実行中の自分自身"
"のバイナリを差し替える必要があり、汎用 install ジョブよりタイトなループのため"
"専用の仕組みを持っています。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:8
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "仕組み"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:10
msgid "Bucket / Key"
msgstr "バケット / キー"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:12
msgid ""
"Agent binaries, keyed by `<version>`. Separate from `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` so "
"the rollout watcher only fires on agent updates."
msgstr ""
"agent バイナリ。キーは `<version>`。rollout watcher が agent アップデート"
"だけに反応するように、`OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` とは別バケット。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:13
msgid "`agent_config.<scope>.target_version`"
msgstr "`agent_config.<scope>.target_version`"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:13
msgid ""
"The version each scope (global / group / pc) should be on. Watched by the "
"agent's `self_update` loop."
msgstr ""
"各スコープ (global / グループ / pc) があるべきバージョン。agent の "
"`self_update` ループがこれを watch しています。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:15
msgid "Flow:"
msgstr "フロー:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:26
msgid ""
"The rollout watcher has to survive a cold broker (e.g. agent and broker boot "
"at the same time after a host reboot). Pre-#226 a permanent `Err(_) => "
"return;` on the first `get_object_store` call killed the watcher forever; "
"the agent would never self-update on that boot. Post-#226 the watcher "
"retries with backoff until the broker is reachable."
msgstr ""
"rollout watcher は cold broker (ホスト再起動後に agent と broker が同時に"
"立ち上がる、など) に耐えなければなりません。#226 以前は最初の "
"`get_object_store` 呼び出しで `Err(_) => return;` してしまうと watcher が"
"恒久的に死んでいて、その起動セッション中は agent が二度と self-update しません"
"でした。#226 以降は watcher が backoff で再試行し、broker に到達できるまで"
"あきらめません。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:35
msgid "1. Build the agent"
msgstr "1. agent をビルド"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:41
msgid "Output: `target/release/kanade-agent.exe`."
msgstr "出力: `target/release/kanade-agent.exe`。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:43
msgid "2. Publish"
msgstr "2. publish"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:49
msgid ""
"The CLI extracts the version from the PE VERSIONINFO resource — no "
"`--version` flag, no chance of a label / binary mismatch."
msgstr ""
"CLI は PE VERSIONINFO リソースからバージョンを自動抽出します — `--version` "
"フラグ不要、ラベルとバイナリの不一致もあり得ません。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:52
msgid "3. Roll out"
msgstr "3. roll out"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:54
msgid "Pick a scope. Start with one canary host:"
msgstr "スコープを選びます。canary 1 台から:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:60
msgid "Watch via ping:"
msgstr "ping で確認:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:67
msgid "If happy, widen:"
msgstr "問題なければ範囲を広げる:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:75
msgid ""
"`--jitter` spreads the actual swap moment across a window so a wide fan-out "
"doesn't hammer the OS service manager on every host at once. Recommended for "
"fleets ≥ 100 hosts."
msgstr ""
"`--jitter` は実際の swap タイミングをある幅で分散させ、大きな fan-out 時に"
"全ホストの OS サービスマネージャを同時に叩かないようにします。100 台以上の "
"fleet では推奨。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:79
msgid "4. Verify"
msgstr "4. 確認"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:86
msgid ""
"Then a fleet-wide spot-check via the SPA Agents page (or `/api/agents`): the "
"`agent_version` column should converge to the new version within `jitter` + "
"~30s heartbeat cadence."
msgstr ""
"あとは SPA の Agents ページ (もしくは `/api/agents`) で fleet 全体を"
"スポットチェック: `agent_version` 列は `jitter` + 約 30 秒の heartbeat "
"間隔以内に新バージョンに収束するはず。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:94
msgid "`kanade agent rollout` says \"version not in OBJECT_AGENT_RELEASES\""
msgstr "`kanade agent rollout` が \"version not in OBJECT_AGENT_RELEASES\" と言う"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:94
msgid "Typo or wrong scope"
msgstr "typo もしくはスコープ違い"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:94
msgid ""
"Re-check with `kanade agent current` and `kanade jetstream object list "
"agent_releases`."
msgstr ""
"`kanade agent current` と `kanade jetstream object list agent_releases` で"
"再確認。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:95
msgid "`kanade ping <host>` still shows the old version after several minutes"
msgstr "数分経っても `kanade ping <host>` が古いバージョンを返す"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:95
msgid ""
"Agent didn't self-update — either the watcher's dead (pre-#226 agent) or the "
"host can't reach the broker"
msgstr ""
"agent が self-update しなかった — watcher が死んでいる (#226 以前の agent) "
"か、ホストが broker に到達できない"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:95
msgid ""
"Check `%ProgramData%\\Kanade\\log\\agent.*.log` on the target. If "
"self_update is silent (no \"checking target_version\" log lines), the agent "
"is too old; bootstrap manually with `deploy-agent.ps1`."
msgstr ""
"対象ホストの `%ProgramData%\\Kanade\\log\\agent.*.log` をチェック。"
"self_update が無言なら (「checking target_version」ログがない)、agent が"
"古すぎる; `deploy-agent.ps1` で手動ブートストラップ。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:96
msgid "Agent flaps: starts, immediately exits with `exit_code: 1`"
msgstr "agent が flap する: 起動するも `exit_code: 1` ですぐ落ちる"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:96
msgid ""
"The new binary is bad on this host (config drift, missing dep, etc.). SCM's "
"failure-actions restart it, it crashes again — observable in Event Viewer as "
"a Service Control Manager error cluster"
msgstr ""
"このホストでは新バイナリが起動できない (config の不整合、依存欠落など)。SCM "
"の failure-actions により再起動が試みられるが再びクラッシュする — Event "
"Viewer に Service Control Manager のエラーが連続して記録される"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:96
msgid ""
"Roll back: `kanade agent rollout <prev-version> --pcs <host>`. The host will "
"swap back at the next watcher tick."
msgstr ""
"ロールバック: `kanade agent rollout <prev-version> --pcs <host>`。"
"次の watcher tick でホストは元のバージョンに戻ります。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:98
msgid "Why a separate bucket / scope?"
msgstr "なぜ別のバケット / スコープか？"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:100
msgid ""
"`OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` is a generic blob store keyed by `<name>/<version>`. "
"The agent rollout pattern needs:"
msgstr ""
"`OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` は `<name>/<version>` をキーにした汎用 blob ストア"
"です。agent rollout パターンに必要なのは:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:103
msgid ""
"A watcher that fires _only_ on agent changes (cheap KV watch on one specific "
"key, not a poll over a bucket of many names)."
msgstr ""
"agent の変更**だけ**に反応する watcher (たくさんの名前が入ったバケットを poll "
"するのではなく、特定の 1 つの KV キーを安価に watch)。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:105
msgid ""
"A \"current target\" semantic per scope, not just \"all known versions\" — "
"`agent_config.<scope>.target_version` IS the answer to \"what should I be "
"running\" without the agent enumerating."
msgstr ""
"「既知の全バージョン」ではなくスコープごとの「現在の target」セマンティクス "
"— `agent_config.<scope>.target_version` こそが「自分は何を動かすべきか」の"
"答えで、agent 側で列挙する必要がない。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:108
msgid ""
"Operator UX (`kanade agent publish` / `rollout`) that's divergent enough "
"from `kanade app publish` to warrant its own subcommand tree."
msgstr ""
"operator 向け UX (`kanade agent publish` / `rollout`) が `kanade app "
"publish` とは別サブコマンドツリーに分けるに足るくらい違う。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:112
msgid ""
"So agents get `OBJECT_AGENT_RELEASES` + a layered config KV; the other "
"components share `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` + per-app jobs."
msgstr ""
"というわけで agent は `OBJECT_AGENT_RELEASES` + レイヤード config KV を、"
"他のコンポーネントは `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES` + アプリ別ジョブを共有します。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:3
msgid ""
"PowerShell scripts the agent will run are _almost_ normal `.ps1` files. This "
"page collects the gotchas that aren't obvious from the script source alone."
msgstr "agent が実行する PowerShell スクリプトは _ほぼ_ 通常の `.ps1` ファイルです。このページは、スクリプトのソースを見るだけでは分からない罠をまとめます。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:7
msgid "The agent stages scripts on disk and runs them via `-File`"
msgstr "agent はスクリプトをディスクに staging してから `-File` で実行する"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:9
msgid ""
"As of [PR #230](https://github.com/yukimemi/kanade/pull/230) (agent version "
"0.42.0+), the agent:"
msgstr "[PR #230](https://github.com/yukimemi/kanade/pull/230) (agent version 0.42.0+) 以降、agent は次の動作をします:"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:12
msgid ""
"Writes your script body to a temp `.ps1` under "
"`%ProgramData%\\Kanade\\agent-scripts\\<UUID>\\kanade-<UUID>.ps1` (Windows) "
"or `$TMPDIR/kanade-agent-<UUID>/kanade-<UUID>.ps1` (non-Windows dev only)."
msgstr "スクリプト本体を temp の `.ps1` に書き出します。Windows なら `%ProgramData%\\Kanade\\agent-scripts\\<UUID>\\kanade-<UUID>.ps1`、それ以外 (dev のみ) なら `$TMPDIR/kanade-agent-<UUID>/kanade-<UUID>.ps1`。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:16
msgid ""
"Writes a _launcher_ `.ps1` next to it that sets UTF-8 console encoding then "
"`& '<your-script>' @args`."
msgstr "その隣に _launcher_ `.ps1` を書き、UTF-8 コンソールエンコーディングを設定してから `& '<your-script>' @args` でユーザースクリプトを呼びます。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:18
msgid ""
"Spawns `powershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "
"<launcher>`."
msgstr "`powershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File <launcher>` を spawn します。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:21
msgid "This means your script:"
msgstr "結果として、あなたのスクリプトでは:"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:23
msgid ""
"**Can** have `[CmdletBinding()]` and `param(...)` at the top. The "
"call-operator boundary in the launcher gives your script its own scope where "
"those headers are valid."
msgstr "先頭に `[CmdletBinding()]` や `param(...)` を **書けます**。launcher の call-operator 境界が独自スコープを生み、その中ではヘッダーが有効です。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:26
msgid ""
"**Should not** rely on `$PSCommandPath` matching the operator's source path "
"— it'll be the staged temp file."
msgstr "`$PSCommandPath` が operator のソースパスと一致することを **期待しないで**ください — staged 後の temp ファイルパスになります。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:28
msgid "**Should not** write to `$PSScriptRoot` (see next section)."
msgstr "`$PSScriptRoot` に **書き込まないで**ください (次節参照)。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:30
msgid ""
"Pre-0.42.0 agents used `powershell -Command \"<body>\"`, which parses the "
"body as a command-line expression and rejects `[CmdletBinding()]` as a "
"syntax error. If you see \"Unexpected token '\\[CmdletBinding()\\]'\" in "
"stderr, the host's agent is too old — upgrade it (see [agent "
"self-update](../operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:37
msgid "`$PSScriptRoot` is read-only for `run_as: user`"
msgstr "`run_as: user` のとき `$PSScriptRoot` は読み取り専用"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:39
msgid ""
"When `run_as: user` (or `system_gui`), the child process runs as the "
"logged-in user — not as the LocalSystem agent that wrote the staged file. "
"The staging directory inherits its ACL from `%ProgramData%`, which grants "
"users **Read & Execute but not Modify**."
msgstr "`run_as: user` (または `system_gui`) のとき、子プロセスはログオン中のユーザーとして動きます — staged ファイルを書いた LocalSystem の agent ではありません。staging ディレクトリは `%ProgramData%` から ACL を継承していて、Users には **Read & Execute は許可されるが Modify は許可されません**。"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:45
msgid "That means:"
msgstr "つまり:"

#: src\developing/writing-agent-scripts.md:57
msgid ""
"Write to `$env:TEMP`, `$env:LOCALAPPDATA`, or an absolute path under the "
"user's profile instead. Even for `run_as: system` (where SYSTEM can write to "
"its own staged dir), the directory is cleaned up when the script exits, so "
"writing siblings is fragile either way."
msgstr "代わりに `$env:TEMP`、`$env:LOCALAPPDATA`、ユーザープロファイル配下の絶対パスのいずれかに書いてください。`run_as: system` (SYSTEM が自分の staged dir に書ける) であっても、スクリプト終了時にディレクトリは掃除されるので、隣接ファイル書き込みはいずれにせよ壊れやすいです。"

